				<wikidot:authorName>Faraday Cage</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1856658</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I can perceive that this writing is meant to summon feels, but the feels just aren't arriving to the dinner table I have carefully set in my head.</p> <p>It's a sense of something striving to be emotive but it's rusted in place.</p> <p>later edit after some thought:</p> <p>Maybe that was the point all along?<br /> Like how that silent Phillip Glass thing made the viewer consciously aware of the background noise of everyday existence&#8230;</p> <p>I can see the metaphorical shape of the absence of shark in my headfeels now.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
